{"id":"vertu","lemma":"vertu","pos":"noun","rank":3807,"glosses":["virtue"],"ipa":"/vɛʁ.ty/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/90/Fr-vertu.ogg/Fr-vertu.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"vertus"},"formAudio":{"vertus":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Mathieu_Kappler-Vertus.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La gentillesse est une vertu.","en":"Kindness is a virtue.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"kindness"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Il passe son temps à prôner ses vertus.","en":"He spends all his time extolling her virtues.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to pass","l":"passer"},{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to extol, praise, laud"},{"g":"his"},null]},{"text":"Je crois à la vertu de se lever tôt.","en":"I believe in getting up early.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to believe","l":"croire"},null,null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to raise, lift"},{"g":"early"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"a la"]]},{"text":"La simplicité est une vertu.","en":"Simplicity is a virtue.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"simplicity"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"L'honnêteté est une vertu.","en":"Honesty is a virtue.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"honesty"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}